## Quick start

```bash
cp .env.example .env
{{#if docker}}docker compose up -d{{/if}}
pnpm install
{{#if isPrisma}}pnpm prisma:generate{{/if}}
pnpm dev
```

Health check: [http://localhost:3000/health](http://localhost:3000/health)

